(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[8] = {"n": 8, "title": "Nouns as Governing Elements", "ar": "الأَسْمَاءُ العَامِلَةُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> can receive a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span> from one relationship and govern another word at the same time. Your aim is to identify both relationships, explain their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>, and express the analysis increasingly in Arabic.</p><p>You need <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل، معمول</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، نائب فاعل، مفعول به، مبتدأ، خبر، حال، مضاف، مضاف إليه</span></b>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحوال الإعراب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، نصب، جرّ، جزم</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></b> describes someone's state during an action; its bearer is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الحال</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف / مفعول فيه</span></b> locates an action in time or place. Necessary form reminders appear within the lessons.</p><p>Keep three questions separate: <b>What kind of word is it? What role does it occupy? What does it govern?</b> “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>” names a word type; “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>” names a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> role and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. Both can describe the same word.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span></th><th>Its work</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شِبْه الفعل</span>: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل</span></td><td>Governs according to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاسم المضاف</span></td><td>Makes its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاسم المبهم التام</span></td><td>Makes its specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الشرط</span></td><td>Governs two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> and also occupies a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> role</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Choose an answer for each question or table row, then press Check. Each has one correct choice. Work out the governing relationship before selecting; use the worked solution to check your reasoning. Later tasks remove translations and vowel marks. Supply endings for connected reading; an incidental vowel used to join words is not a change in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "How the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> governs", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَصْدَر</span></b> names an action without itself marking a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمن</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span></b> “he wrote,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتَابَة</span></b> “writing”; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأَ</span></b> “he read,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَة</span></b> “reading.” It can govern the participants in that action. These forms must be learned with their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>; do not assume every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> follows one pattern.</p><p>The usual governing form is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى معموله</span></b>, attached by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to a word belonging to its action. That word may be the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, or another related expression such as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجرّ</span> alone does not tell you who performed the action.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Read the relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَةُ الطَّالِبِ الكِتَابَ نَافِعَةٌ</span>.</b>: The student's reading of the book is useful.</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span> is the reader; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَةُ الكِتَابِ نَافِعَةٌ</span>.</b>: Reading the book is useful.</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span> is what is read; the reader is unexpressed</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَةُ اللَّيْلِ نَافِعَةٌ</span>.</b>: Reading at night is useful.</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الليلِ</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span> relationship, not the reader</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Forms and restrictions</h2><p>A governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span></b> is also allowed: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِطْعَامٌ يَتِيمًا</span></b>, “feeding an orphan.” Its governing use with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></b> is exceptional, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شاذّ</span></b>; do not use that rare pattern as your normal model.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can leave its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> unexpressed <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلا نائب</span></b>, without introducing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>. This does not turn it into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span>. Other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء عاملة</span> require the appropriate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>, whether <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span>.</p><p>Use the majority ordering rule here: its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span></b> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> that may precede it. Do not move an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in front merely because a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> can precede a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَةُ الطَّالِبِ الكِتَابَ نَافِعَةٌ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مصدر عامل ومضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة؛ وهو فاعل المصدر في المعنى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة الجرّ</span> expresses the reader through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للمصدر منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعةٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>. It agrees with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث قراءة</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Forms and restrictions"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the term described in each row.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span></b>: names an action without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمن</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span></b>: receives the work of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></b>: performs the action; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></b>: locates an action in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Names an action without itself marking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "Receives the work of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "Performs the action", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "Locates the action in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الكتابَ نافعةٌ</span></b>: the student reads the book.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الكتابَ نافعةٌ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and is the reader in meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>. Do not give the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>'s ending merely because both belong to the same action.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه؛ مفعول به في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور؛ فاعل المصدر في المعنى</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للمصدر منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "1G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعامُ اليتيمِ حسنٌ</span></b> means “Feeding the orphan is good.” Choose the analysis.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليتيم</span> is the one fed: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور، مفعول به في المعنى</span></b>. The feeder is unexpressed. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> is required; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> permits omission of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> without replacement.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليتيمِ: مضاف إليه؛ مفعول به في المعنى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> may be omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلا نائب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليتيمِ: مضاف إليه؛ فاعل في المعنى</span>. The orphan performs the feeding.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليتيمِ: نائب فاعل</span>, because the feeder is unexpressed."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابة الطالب الرسالة واضحة</span></b>: “The student’s writing of the letter is clear.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتَابَةُ الطَّالِبِ الرِّسَالَةَ وَاضِحَةٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةُ: مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة، مصدر عامل ومضاف. الطالبِ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة، فاعل المصدر في المعنى. الرسالةَ: مفعول به للمصدر منصوب بالفتحة. واضحةٌ: خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>. The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> judges the writing to be clear.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةُ: مبتدأ مرفوع، مصدر عامل ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةَ: مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةِ: مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبَ: مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ: مضاف إليه، فاعل المصدر في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ: فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ: مفعول به للمصدر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةُ: نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واضحة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واضحةٌ: خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واضحةٍ: نعت مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واضحةً: حال منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> cannot govern a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.”", "sol": "<p>A governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> is permissible: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعامٌ يتيمًا</span></b>, “feeding an orphan.” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتيمًا</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب. إضافة</span> is the usual form, not the only form; governing use with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> is exceptional.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["It can: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعامٌ يتيمًا</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتيمًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.", "Correct: only a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> can govern.", "It can only when it also carries <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ الطالبُ الرسالةَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةُ الطالبِ الرسالةَ واضحةٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The student performs the writing, and the letter receives it in both constructions. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ الطالبُ الرسالةَ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابةُ الطالبِ الرسالةَ واضحةٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span> remains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, now governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابة. كتابة</span> itself is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واضحة</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["The second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابة</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>.", "The student writes in the first, but receives the writing in the second.", "The student writes in both; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل المصدر في المعنى</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز حذف فاعل المصدر بلا نائب</span>.</b> Apply this to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ نافعةٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>“The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> may be omitted without a replacement.” In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ نافعةٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is what is read. Do not turn it into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> or invent a required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> reader in the analysis.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span> must contain a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> identifying a particular reader.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> whenever the reader is omitted.", "The reader may be unexpressed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span> is what is read, not a required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "What <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المفعول</span> govern", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Forms and core work</h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُشْتَقّ</span></b> is formed from another word and retains a connection to its meaning. An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span></b> identifies the performer: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَاتِب</span></b>, writer. An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span></b> identifies what receives the action: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَكْتُوب</span></b>, written. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُكْرِم / مُكْرَم</span></b>, honouring / honoured. The vowel before the last consonant matters.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> works like its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل معلوم</span></b>: it raises a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and, if the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدٍّ</span>, takes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> works like its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول</span></b>: it raises a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>. Apply the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> below to both types, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span> governs</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Work permitted</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></b></td><td>Governs its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>, whether <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر</span>, and other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمولات</span> without the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط الزمن والاعتماد</span> below</td></tr><tr><td>Without <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></b>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span></td><td>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> does not require those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span></td></tr><tr><td>Without <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></b>, governing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر, نائب فاعل ظاهر</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span></td><td>Requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال/الاستقبال</span> meaning and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span></b>, support from a suitable construction</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> may be on a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span></b>, something occupying its position such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span></b>, a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الحال</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام</span></b>, or a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span></b>. Do not mistake “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال/الاستقبال</span>” for the date of the narrator: a past scene can be presented as unfolding, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكاية الحال</span></b>.</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ كَاتِبٌ رِسَالَةً الآنَ</span>.</b>: Khalid is writing a letter now. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span> depends on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>, and means a present action.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ خَالِدًا كَاتِبٌ رِسَالَةً</span>.</b>: Khalid is writing a letter. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span> provides the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ خَالِدٌ حَامِلًا كِتَابًا</span>.</b>: Khalid came carrying a book. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملًا</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الحال خالد</span>; the carrying is concurrent with that scene.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَا نَاصِرٌ خَالِدٌ سَعِيدًا</span>.</b>: Khalid is not helping Saʿīd. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصر</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر, سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>, making a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> unnecessary.</li></ul><p>An adjacent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> may appear with its ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, or through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> where that relationship is permitted: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبٌ الرسالةَ / كاتبُ الرسالةِ</span></b>. Do not make a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل منصوب</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مرفوع</span> at will. If the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> is separated from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>, retain its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ كاتبٌ في البيتِ رسالةً</span></b>. The intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> prevents direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ كَاتِبٌ رِسَالَةً</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع، وهو اسم فاعل عامل لاعتماده على المبتدأ ودلالته على الحال</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره هو</span></b> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطَّالِبُ مَحْمُودٌ خُلُقُهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The student's character is praised.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمودٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع واسم مفعول عامل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلُقُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل لاسم المفعول مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه يعود إلى الطالب</span>. The praised thing is his character; do not call it the praiser.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Forms and core work"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span> governs"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the forms with their meanings.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب</span></b>: writer; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكتوب</span></b>: written; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُكرِم</span></b>: honouring; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُكرَم</span></b>: honoured. The internal vowel distinguishes the last two forms.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["written", "writer", "honoured"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكتوب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["honouring", "writer", "written"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُكرِم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["honoured", "written", "honouring"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُكرَم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["honoured", "writer", "honouring"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ سعيدًا حافظٌ الدرسَ الآنَ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حافظ</span> = memorising.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ سعيدًا حافظٌ الدرسَ الآنَ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span> and provides the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد. حافظٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد. الدرسَ</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به. الآن</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span> attached to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حافظ</span> and establishes the present meaning.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد حافظ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["On <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ: سعيدًا</span>", "On a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "On <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حافظٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع واسم فاعل عامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل حافظ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى سعيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ محمودٌ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> to say that his character is praised.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ محمودٌ خُلُقُهُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>, governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span>, and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف. ه</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>. The character is praised; it does not perform the praising.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلُقَهُ: مفعول به منصوب، عامله محمود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلُقِهِ: مضاف إليه، مع بقاء تنوين محمودٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُلُقُهُ: نائب فاعل مرفوع، عامله محمود</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد حامل في يده كتابا</span></b>, describing a current action.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَامِلٌ فِي يَدِهِ كِتَابًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد: مبتدأ مرفوع. حامل: خبر مرفوع واسم فاعل عامل، يعتمد على المبتدأ ويدل على الحال؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو. في: حرف جر. يدِ: اسم مجرور وهو مضاف. ه: مضاف إليه يعود إلى خالد. في يده: متعلق بحامل. كتابًا: مفعول به لاسم الفاعل منصوب</span>. The intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> separates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>, so this is not direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ: خبر مرفوع واسم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملًا: حال منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل حامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى خالد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في يده</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مستقل لا تعلّق له بحامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلق بحامل؛ الهاء مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حرف نصب؛ يدَه مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابِ: مضاف إليه لحامل رغم الفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: مفعول به؛ الفصل يمنع الإضافة المباشرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ: نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose a correction for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد كاتبٌ الرسالةَ أمسِ</span></b> meaning a completed action yesterday, without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكاية الحال</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ خَالِدٌ الرِّسَالَةَ أَمْسِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب: فعل ماضٍ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد: فاعل مرفوع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة: مفعول به منصوب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمسِ: ظرف زمان مبني على الكسر في محل نصب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل مجرّد من أل</span>'s ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المفعول به الصريح</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال/الاستقبال</span> meaning plus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span>. The specified completed past does not meet that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكاية الحال</span> interpretation was explicitly excluded.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["Change only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةُ</span>: every past <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> takes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ خالدٌ الرسالةَ أمسِ؛ اسم الفاعل المجرّد من أل</span> here lacks the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال/الاستقبال</span> meaning.", "Keep it unchanged: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> alone is sufficient for this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ نافعةٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ قارئٌ الكتابَ الآنَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ نافعةٌ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> may remain unexpressed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in meaning. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ قارئٌ الكتابَ الآنَ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب. قارئ</span> depends on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and denotes the present action. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> is not the same as permitted omission without a replacement.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["Neither has any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> in both.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> may omit its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل بلا نائب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قارئ</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو. الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in the first and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> in the second.", "Both must contain the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> in both."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعمل اسم المفعول عمل فعله المجهول</span>.</b> Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ محمودٌ خلقُه</span></b> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> works like its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل معلوم</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> like its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول. خلقه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span> because it is what receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدح</span>; it is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> left after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The character performs the praising; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span> works like its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل معلوم</span>.", "The character receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدح</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span> works like its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "Qualities and intensity: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المبالغة</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة باسم الفاعل</span></h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صِفَة مُشَبَّهَة بِاسْم الفاعل</span></b> expresses a quality, for example <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَسَن</span></b> “good, beautiful” and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَرِيع</span></b> “swift.” It derives from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل لازم</span>. Nevertheless, it can resemble <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل متعدٍّ إلى مفعول واحد</span> in the way it gives an ending to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> that specifies the quality.</p><p>The related <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is still the bearer of that quality in meaning. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> form does not make it a genuine recipient of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدٍّ</span> action.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Analysis of the related <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَسَنٌ خُلُقُهُ</span>.</b>: Khalid's character is good.</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه: فاعل مرفوع</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَسَنٌ خُلُقَهُ</span>.</b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم معرفة: منصوب على المفعولية</span>, resembling a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; still the quality-bearer in meaning</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَسَنٌ خُلُقًا</span>.</b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم نكرة: تمييز منصوب</span>, specifying “good in what respect?”</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَسَنُ الخُلُقِ</span>.</b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالإضافة</span>; the quality-bearer in meaning</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span></b> means “in the expressed form”; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلًّا</span></b> means “in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل إعرابي</span>.” In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة منصوب</span> pattern, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في المعنى، منصوب لفظًا، مرفوع محلًّا</span></b>; in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> pattern, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا، مرفوع محلًّا</span></b>. This preserves the distinction between the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظيّ</span> and the underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship. Do not extend this wording to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة تمييز</span> pattern.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن الخلق</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلق</span> can supply the connection otherwise expressed by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـه</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المبالغة</span></h2><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبالغة</span></b> intensifies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غَفَّار</span></b> “one who forgives abundantly,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَّال</span></b> “one who does much.” It has the work of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>. Recognise the form and then ask what its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span> governs; an intensive meaning does not make the word a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ اللهَ غَفَّارٌ الذُّنُوبَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Allah forgives sins abundantly. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غفّارٌ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span> and governs <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنوبَ</span></b> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذُنُوب</span></b> = sins. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span> are explicit here; no unsupported pattern needs to be inferred.</span></div><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ حَسَنُ الخُلُقِ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع، صفة مشبهة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلقِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة؛ فاعل في المعنى، مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقًا</span></b>: retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span> and analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة باسم الفاعل</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المبالغة</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse the word specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span> in each expression.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقُه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقَه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة منصوب</span> resembling a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز نكرة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقُه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقَه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة منصوب لفظًا على المفعولية، فاعل في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة منصوب على التمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة منصوب على التمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة منصوب على المفعولية</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور؛ فاعل في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح لفعل متعدٍّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقَهُ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حسنٌ خلقَهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا، مرفوع محلًّا</span></b>. His character bears the quality “good.” This does not assert that Khalid acts upon it to beautify it. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> derives from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل لازم</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> pattern resembles <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به عمل</span> for expressive force.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا ومحلًّا؛ خالد</span> performs an action of beautifying it.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا؛</span> his character bears the quality.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع لفظًا ومحلًّا؛</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> is merely a pronunciation choice."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3G-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ اللهَ غفّارٌ الذنوبَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غفّار</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبالغة</span></b>, expressing abundant forgiveness. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع</span>, has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span>, and governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنوبَ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب. إنّ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهَ</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>; it does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنوب منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غفّار</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبالغة، خبر إنّ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول، اسم إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنوبَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم المبالغة منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل غفّار</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد سريع حسابه</span></b> to produce the requested analysis. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حساب</span> = reckoning.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابُهُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حساب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسابًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعُ الحسابِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحساب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and the quality-bearer in meaning, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا. سعيد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سريع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in each.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع لفظًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعُ الحسابِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابُهُ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابُهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعُ الحسابِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ الحسابِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعٌ حسابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ سريعُ الحسابِ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حسنُ الخلقِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلق</span> from being the quality-bearer.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلقِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span> in the expressed construction. It remains the bearer of the quality: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في المعنى، مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>. Its visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجرّ</span> does not turn it into something acted upon or remove its underlying relationship to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلقِ</span> becomes a true <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل متعدٍّ</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> always removes every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship, including in meaning.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخلقِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور لفظًا، فاعل في المعنى مرفوع محلًّا</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه</span></b> have a different role in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمودٌ خلقُه</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقُه</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span>: “praised,” so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلق</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>, the thing praised. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span>: “good,” so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلق</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, the bearer of goodness. Both expressions have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مرفوع</span>, but the relationships differ.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> raising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span> raising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in both.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> in both."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة مشتقة من فعل لازم</span>.</b> What follows for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقَهُ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>“<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة باسم الفاعل</span> derives from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل لازم</span>.” Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة اسم منصوب</span> is likened to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in form; it remains the bearer of the quality, not a true <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدٍّ</span> action.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The expression is impossible: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span> never governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> resembles a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in form but still bears the quality in meaning.", "The original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> must therefore be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدّيًا</span> to one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "Comparing qualities with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم التفضيل</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Core rule and terminology</h2><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم تفضيل</span></b> compares a quality: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْبَر</span></b> “bigger,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفْضَل</span></b> “better.” The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُفَضَّل</span></b> possesses more of the quality; the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُفَضَّل عليه</span></b> is the person or thing against which that quality is compared.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ أَفْضَلُ مِنْ سَعِيدٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid is better than Saʿīd.</span></div><p>The three components are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد, أفضل</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد. أفضل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>; its normal grammatical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>, referring to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل خالد</span>. Do not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: it is governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Form follows the construction</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Rule of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Followed by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ للمفضّل عليه</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختِها</span></b>: Fatimah is older than her sister</td></tr><tr><td>Added to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم نكرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ أفضلُ طالبٍ</span></b>: Khalid is the best student</td></tr><tr><td>Added to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم معرفة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ أفضلُ القومِ / أفاضلُ القومِ</span></b>: The students are the best of the group</td></tr><tr><td>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> required</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدارُ الكبرى</span></b>: the larger/greatest house</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُبْرَى</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبر</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفَاضِل</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضل</span>. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> meaning “the best of this group,” the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل</span> belongs to that group. Do not choose such an analysis if it would falsely assert membership.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">What it governs</h2><p>Its <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به غير صريح</span></b> is connected by a suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحرصُ على الحياةِ</span></b>, “more eager for life.” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> is frequent with this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>; words of knowing use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ب</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلمُ بالأمرِ</span></b>, “more knowledgeable about the matter.” Do not replace the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span> indiscriminately.</p><p>For ordinary analysis here, do not assign a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم التفضيل</span>. An apparent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> may instead depend on an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, or on an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة استفهامية</span> can also suspend direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>. A recognised alternative permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المفعول به الصريح</span>. These are distinct analyses, not permission to treat every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلم</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s4\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر: مسألة الكحل</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَا رَأَيْتُ رَجُلًا أَحْسَنَ فِي عَيْنِهِ الكُحْلُ مِنْهُ فِي عَيْنِ زَيْدٍ</span>.</b></div><p>“I have seen no man in whose eye kohl is more beautiful than it is in Zayd's eye.” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكُحْل</span></b> = kohl; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span></b> = eye.</p><p>Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسن</span> raises a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر, الكحل</span>. Recognise all four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط: نفي</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جنس رجلًا</span>; that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> described by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم التفضيل</span>; and a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> compared with itself in two settings. Kohl in one eye is compared with kohl in the other, not the man with the kohl. Keep this marked pattern distinct from the normal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَاطِمَةُ أَكْبَرُ مِنْ أُخْتِهَا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبرُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع، اسم تفضيل؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هي</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للمفضّل عليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أختِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بمن، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه. مذكر مفرد أكبر</span> is required even though its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Core rule and terminology"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Form follows the construction"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "What it governs"}, {"id": "L4-s4", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر: مسألة الكحل</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ أفضلُ من خالدٍ</span></b>: distinguish the roles.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد: مفضّل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ. أفضل: اسم تفضيل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد. خالد: مفضّل عليه, مجرور بمن</span>. A semantic comparison component and a grammatical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> are not interchangeable labels.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ ومفضّل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل عليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر لأفضل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضلُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع، فاعله خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر واسم تفضيل، فاعله مستتر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل عليه مجرور بمن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل اسم التفضيل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the appropriate form.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن للمفضّل عليه</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد أكبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدارُ الكبرى</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم تفضيل</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مطابقة في التأنيث</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدار. كبرى</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ <span class=\"blank\"></span> من أختها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبرُ: يلزم الإفراد والتذكير مع مِن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كبرى: تجب المطابقة مع فاطمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأكبرُ: تلزم أل مع مِن</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدارُ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأكبرُ: يلزم التذكير مع أل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبرُ من: دون ذكر مفضّل عليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكبرى: تجب المطابقة مع أل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالأمرِ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلمُ بالأمرِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالأمرِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به غير صريح</span>, connected through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ. ب</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ, الأمر</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> attaches to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلم</span>. It is not a direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به غير صريح؛ الباء حرف جرّ، والأمر مجرور، والجار والمجرور متعلق بأعلم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لأعلم؛ الباء علامة الإضافة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح منصوب بأعلم، والباء لا تعمل</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات أفضل من الطلاب</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطَّالِبَاتُ أَفْضَلُ مِنَ الطُّلَّابِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات: مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة. أفضل: خبر مرفوع، اسم تفضيل مفرد مذكر؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هنّ. من: حرف جر. الطلاب: اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The vowel on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنَ</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> enables connected pronunciation; it is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالباتِ: اسم إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالباتُ: مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالباتَ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفضلى: تلزم المطابقة هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفاضلُ: تلزم المطابقة هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضلُ: خبر مفرد مذكر مع مِن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل أفضل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى الطلاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابِ: مجرور بمن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيتُ رجلًا أحسنَ في عينه الكحلُ منه في عين زيدٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسألة الكحل</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحلُ</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسن</span>. The two settings are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في عينه</span></b> (the man's eye) and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في عين زيد</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منه</span> refers to the kohl. The same substance is compared in two settings; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span> supplies the generic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> being described, not one of the two things being compared.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل أحسن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحلُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "The comparison", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>, regardless of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحل في عين الرجل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكحل في عين زيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ كاتبٌ رسالةً</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ أفضلُ من سعيدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> meaning, works like a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل معلوم متعدٍّ</span> and governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> directly. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضل</span> has its normal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> but connects its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل عليه</span> by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> is therefore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. A shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> role does not entail identical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفضّل عليه</span>.", "Both following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر</span> of the preceding word.", "Both following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span>, with interchangeable endings."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يلزم اسم التفضيل الإفراد والتذكير إذا تلاه مِنْ للمفضّل عليه</span>.</b> Choose the application.", "sol": "<p>“<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم التفضيل</span> must remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مذكر</span> when followed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span> introducing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفضّل عليه</span>.” Thus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبر</span> is correct with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>, while its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر فاعل</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث هي</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختها؛ أكبر</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفردًا مذكرًا</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختها؛</span> the form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبر</span> means its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ كبرى من أختها؛</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> referred to requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كبرى</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأفعال</span> and other expressions with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span></b> has the meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> without being a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> form. Identify what <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> it means before deciding whether it needs a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Time meaning</th><th>Expression</th><th>Equivalent</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Past</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَيْهَاتَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شَتَّانَ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَعُدَ</span>: was distant / far apart</td></tr><tr><td>Present</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُفٍّ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَيْ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَتَضَجَّرُ</span>: I am vexed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَعْجَبُ</span>: I marvel</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَهْ، مَهْ، آمِينَ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُسْكُتْ، اكْفُفْ، اسْتَجِبْ</span>: be silent, desist, answer</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَلْهَ الشَّرَّ؛ دُونَكَ الكِتَابَ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُتْرُكِ الشرَّ؛ خُذِ الكتابَ</span>: leave evil; take the book</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Other useful recognised forms are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رُوَيْدَ</span></b> “give respite,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَلُمَّ</span></b> “bring / come,” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَيَّ، حَيَّهَلْ</span></b> “come forward,” and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُرْعَانَ</span></b> “how quickly!” The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">س</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرعان</span> also occurs with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة. هلم</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدٍّ</span> “bring” or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لازم</span> “come”; let its construction decide.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Origin and behaviour</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span></b> means learned from established usage. Such forms are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرتجل</span></b>, originally used as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل (صه، هيهات</span>), or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقول</span></b>, transferred from another use:</p><ul><li>From a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عليكَ</span></b> meaning <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزمْ</span></b>, “adhere to.”</li><li>From a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ</span></b> “take”; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمامكَ</span></b> “move forward.”</li><li>From a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ</span></b> “leave.”</li><li>From an attention expression: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاءَ</span></b> “take”; recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاؤم</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاتوا</span></b> as related forms used for addressing a group in this treatment.</li></ul><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ</span></b> means formed by a pattern. Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَالِ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَزَالِ</span></b>, “come down,” corresponding to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انزلْ</span></b>; its final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> marks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>. Learn this pattern before attempting to coin further forms.</p><p>Some forms vary with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عليكَ، عليكما، عليكم</span></b>; others remain unchanged, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيهات</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بله</span>. This kind of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرّف</span></b> is not ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصريف الفعل الماضي والمضارع</span>. Their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمـول</span> may not precede them: use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ الكتابَ</span></b>, not <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ دونكَ</span></b> when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span> is intended as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Small forms that change the analysis</h2><p>Without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ الشرَّ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رويدَ المفلسَ</span></b> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهًا</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رويدًا</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> serving as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span></b> for understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> in this analysis. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًا</span></b>, “give them a little respite,” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رويدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>, not a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفلس</span></b> = an insolvent person.</p><p>Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويكأنّ</span></b> without forcing one parsing: it can be explained through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وي</span> “I marvel” with causal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ</span>; through an address <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span> with an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ</span>; through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وي</span> plus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّ</span> of comparison; through a shortened <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويلك</span> with an understood “know”; or as an expression of regret with address <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span>. These are reading alternatives, not a construction to generate by guessing.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s4\">Other expressions with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span></h2><ul><li>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span></b>, including a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> with an understood meaning “be situated,” can work like <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استقرّ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفِي الدَّارِ رَجُلٌ؟</span></b>, one analysis makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعلًا</span> for that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>; another makes it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخرًا</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر شبه جملة مقدّم</span>. Keep each analysis consistent.</li><li>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منسوب</span></b>, ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـيّ</span>, can work like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> when it means “related to”: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ قُرَشِيٌّ أبوهُ</span></b>, “Khalid's father is of Quraysh.” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> for the sense <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منسوب</span>. When a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منسوب</span> conveys a quality instead, the analysis follows that quality: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحَمَّدِيًّا خُلُقُهُ</span></b> can mean “good in character,” with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقه فاعلًا</span> for the understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span>.</li><li>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد مؤوّل بمشتقّ</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جامد</span> understood with a derived meaning, can support <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وهو اللهُ في السماواتِ وفي الأرضِ</span></b>, the sense <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستحقّ للعبادة</span></b>, “entitled to worship,” explains the connection of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>. The wording does not imply physical location for Allah.</li></ul><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَلْهَ الشَّرَّ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Leave evil.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر مبني على الفتح بمعنى اترك، لا محل له من الإعراب</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشرَّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. Contrast <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صهْ</span></b>: its meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لازم</span>, so it has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت</span> but no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Origin and behaviour"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Small forms that change the analysis"}, {"id": "L5-s4", "title": "Other expressions with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> with its meaning.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيهات</span></b>: past distance; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفّ</span></b>: present vexation; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمين</span></b>: “answer!”; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صه</span></b>: “be silent!”</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هيهات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استجبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَعُدَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكتْ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استجبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أتضجّرُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَعُدَ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكتْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استجبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أتضجّرُ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَعُدَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استجبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكتْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the analysis for “Leave evil.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ الشرَّ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بله: اسم فعل أمر</span> meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اترك, مبني على الفتح</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت. الشر: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ الشرَّ: اسم فعل أمر، فاعله مستتر أنت؛ الشرَّ مفعول به منصوب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ الشرِّ: اسم فعل أمر؛ الشرِّ مجرور به</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلهَ الشرُّ: اسم فعل أمر؛ الشرُّ فاعله الظاهر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رويدًا</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمهلْهُ رويدًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رويدًا</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> providing the sense of respite, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر أمهل</span> is already present. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> meaning alone cannot decide a word's <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم نحويّ</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع،</span> because it follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمهل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق،</span> not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> in this construction.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر،</span> because every expression of a request has that category."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the order and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> for “Take the book.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دُونَكَ الكِتَابَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر</span> meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خذ, مبني</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت. ك</span> marks the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى, حرف خطاب لا محل له</span>, rather than a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span> in this use. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل عامل</span>. Contrast the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> use of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دون</span> with an attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> meaning controls the analysis here.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Order", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ الكتابَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ الكتابُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ دونكَ</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> use"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ بمعنى أخذ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر بمعنى خذ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span> in this use", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل متصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل دونك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفي الدارِ رجلٌ؟</span></b> Match each recognised analysis to its account.", "sol": "<p>First: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة استفهام</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الدار</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ معتمد على الاستفهام</span> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل استقرّ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>. Second: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الدار</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر شبه جملة مقدّم</span> attached to omitted general existence; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع. في</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدار</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in both accounts. The first account expressly attributes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الفاعل</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مستقرّ</span> works like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استقرّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: فاعل مرفوع لذلك المعنى</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الدار</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: فاعل ظاهر لفي</span> under this same account", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: خبر ثانٍ بلا مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: مبتدأ مؤخر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدار</span> in both accounts", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع برجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالهمزة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صهْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكتْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Both mean “Be silent!” and have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صهْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر مبني على السكون؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكتْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على السكون</span>. Neither is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع</span> made <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span> by an earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>. The same visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> can mark <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> in different word classes.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم</span> by an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صه: اسم فعل أمر؛ اسكت: فعل أمر</span>. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر أنت</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صه</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> at all, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسكت</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر أنت</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز تقديم معمول اسم الفعل عليه</span>.</b> Which follows the rule for “Take the book”?", "sol": "<p>“The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> may not be placed before it.” Therefore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> pattern. Moving it forward cannot be justified from the freer order of some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ دونكَ؛</span> the ordinary freedom of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> order applies unchanged.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ الكتابَ؛ الكتاب</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ دونكَ؛</span> changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> permits the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> analysis."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "Relationships and meaning in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة المعنوية</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Core rule and terminology</h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></b> makes the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. Use the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> as the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> in your analysis; an alternative attributes the work to an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span></b>, also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة محضة</span></b>, establishes a substantive relationship rather than merely shortening a current construction with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل</span>. Its second term provides <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span></b> if <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>, or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص</span></b>, narrowing the meaning, if <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتَابُ الطَّالِبِ</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">the student's book: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتَابُ طَالِبٍ</span></b>: a student's book: restricted but still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</span></div><table><thead><tr><th>Understood relationship</th><th>Example</th><th>Expansion of meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لـ</span></b>: ownership or association</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span></b></td><td>a book belonging to the student</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ</span></b>: part of a whole</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آياتُ القرآنِ</span></b></td><td>verses from the Qur'an</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>: setting</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلاةُ الليلِ</span></b></td><td>prayer in the night</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The expansion explains meaning; it does not insert an extra written word into your <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>. If a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> second expression is intended but the first must remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, express the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ للطالبِ</span></b>, “a book belonging to the student.” This is not the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب الطالب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> still has its own role</h2><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ مُعَلِّمُ الطَّالِبِ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ مُعَلِّمَ الطَّالِبِ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بِمُعَلِّمِ الطَّالِبِ</span></b>. The teacher is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, then <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, then governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ب. الطالب</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span> because its relationship to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span> stays the same. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span> identifies the student's teacher, rather than a currently governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ كِتَابَ الطَّالِبِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I read the student's book.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li></ul><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>. The entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> expression means “the student's book,” but only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> directly receives the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Core rule and terminology"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> still has its own role"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span> with its understood relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب الطالب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span>, ownership/association. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آيات القرآن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>, part of a whole. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلاة الليل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في, ظرف زمان</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: ظرفية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لـ: ملك أو اختصاص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن: بعض من كلّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آياتُ القرآنِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لـ: ملك الطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن: بعض من كلّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: ظرفية</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلاةُ الليلِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن: بعض من كلّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: ظرفية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لـ: ملك شخص</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ <span class=\"blank\"></span> الطالبِ</span></b> and explain the two endings.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ كتابَ الطالبِ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف كتاب</span>. The two words do not share the same immediate grammatical relationship.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابَ: مفعول به لقرأت؛ الطالبِ: مضاف إليه لكتاب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ: فاعل لقرأت؛ الطالبِ: مضاف إليه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابِ</span>: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> must itself be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose “a book belonging to the student,” keeping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب نكرة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ للطالبِ</span></b>. Expressing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> to remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب الطالب, إضافة معنوية</span> to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم معرفة</span> makes the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم معرفة</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ للطالبِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ للطالبِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحت باب بيت</span></b>: “I opened the door of a house.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَتَحْتُ بَابَ بَيْتٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحتُ: فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون؛ التاء في محل رفع فاعل. بابَ: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة ومضاف. بيتٍ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به شبه جملة</span> is restricted but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ؛ التاء مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع؛ التاء حرف مضارعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ؛ التاء فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابَ: مفعول به ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابِ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتًا: مفعول به ثانٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتٌ: خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتٍ: مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب بيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مخصّصة بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة بأل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة بالإضافة إلى معرفة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في غرفة معلم الطالب كتاب</span></b>: “In the room of the student’s teacher there is a book.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِي غُرْفَةِ مُعَلِّمِ الطَّالِبِ كِتَابٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: حرف جر. غرفةِ: اسم مجرور بفي، وهو مضاف. معلّمِ: مضاف إليه لغرفة مجرور، وهو مضاف أيضًا. الطالبِ: مضاف إليه لمعلّم مجرور</span>. The entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> attaches to an omitted general-existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and occupies the fronted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر. كتابٌ: مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع. معلّم</span> is both a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and a first term governing a further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفةَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفةُ: مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفةِ: مجرور بفي ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَ: مفعول به لغرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمِ: مضاف إليه لغرفة، وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ: مضاف إليه لمعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ: خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبَ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في غرفة معلّم الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية في محل جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ: مضاف إليه للطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ: مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6R", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ كتابَ الطالبِ نافعٌ</span></b>: name the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and role.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابَ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعٌ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ. كتاب</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> describes the relation to the following word; the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s own position determines its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب بإنّ، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لنافع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لأنه مضاف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لنافع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور؛ عامله كتاب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع بإنّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفيد الإضافة المعنوية التعريف أو التخصيص</span>.</b> Apply it.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span> confers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ بيتٍ</span></b> is restricted but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. Neither relationship gives the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> a fixed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> independent of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> role.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ بيتٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص مع بقاء التنكير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف لأن بيت معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تعريف ولا تخصيص لأنها لفظية</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تعريف لأنها لفظية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص مع بقاء التنكير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف بالإضافة إلى معرفة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "How <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة اللفظية</span> preserves <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Core distinction</h2><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span></b>, also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة غير محضة</span></b>, links a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتقّ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل</span> to its participant. It lightens the expression, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخفيف</span></b>, by dropping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> or the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى/جمع نون</span>. It does not itself supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاملٌ الكتابَ الآنَ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid is carrying the book now.</span></div><p>The second version preserves the carrying relationship. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in form but remains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in meaning. This is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على نيّة الانفصال</span></b>: the relationship can be understood in its uncontracted form. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ</span></b>, in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> meaning, remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">Recognise the permitted relationships</h2><table><thead><tr><th>First word and its participant</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span> with its quality-bearer</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ التوبةِ</span></b>: whose repentance is accepted</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لازم اسم فاعل</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, understood as a quality</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعُ المغفرةِ</span></b>: abundant in forgiveness</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعدٍّ اسم فاعل</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>: present, future, or renewed action</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ غدًا</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صادقُ الوعدِ</span></b>, repeatedly true to a promise</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء المبالغة</span> also belong to this group with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل</span>. Occasionally a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان/مكان</span> relation is included by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتّساع</span></b>, an extension of usage: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحبي السجن</span></b> can convey “my two companions in prison.” Do not infer that every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> denoting a place is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>'s form does not settle the kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> added to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, distinguish a current/future or renewed action from a completed past or an enduring attribute:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ الآنَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>, a current writer of it.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ أمسِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span> when identifying the person who wrote it yesterday.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غافرِ الذنبِ وقابلِ التوبِ</span></b>, understood as abiding attributes: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذنب</span></b> = sin; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوب</span></b> = repentance.</li></ul><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متجدّد</span></b> means recurring in particular acts; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دوام</span></b> here means an abiding attribute. Do not decide merely from the English word “always.” State the intended sense.</p><p>The working distinction is that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> does not confer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>. A recognised alternative does allow that effect. Occasional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> descriptions without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد العقاب</span> in a sequence of attributes, also have an analysis with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> understood as omitted for parallel phrasing where no confusion results. Keep these reading alternatives separate from the rule used in practice.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ الطَّالِبَ حَامِلُ الكِتَابِ الآنَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبه بالفعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع، اسم فاعل، وهو مضاف إضافة لفظية</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور لفظًا، مفعول به في المعنى</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآنَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان مبني على الفتح في محل نصب، متعلق بحامل</span>. The uncontracted relationship is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ الكتابَ</span></b>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Core distinction"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "Recognise the permitted relationships"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>'s form does not settle the kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Expand each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> without changing the participant relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ الكتابَ الآنَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوبة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>. The expansion follows the kind of derived <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, not a rule making every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> after expansion <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ الكتابُ الآنَ؛ الكتاب نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ الكتابَ الآنَ؛ الكتاب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ الكتابِ الآنَ؛ جرّ بدون إضافة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ التوبةِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةِ؛ جرّ مع التنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةُ؛ التوبة نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةَ؛ التوبة مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Classify each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and its effect.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية</span>, making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب معرفة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية</span>, not making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن معرفة</span>. The quality-bearer relationship underlies the latter.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية؛ تفيد التعريف هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية؛ تبقي باب نكرة هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية؛ لا تفيد التعريف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليست إضافة لأن الخلق فيه أل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية؛ تفيد التعريف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية؛ لا تفيد التعريف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Classify <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ</span></b> according to the stated meaning.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ أمسِ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي المنقضي</span> identification is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية</span>. With present writing, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ الآنَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية</span>, understood as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبٌ الرسالةَ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s outward pattern alone cannot settle the classification.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "The letter was completed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليست إضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية للحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "He is writing it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية للمضيّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليست إضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الضيف مقبول العذر</span></b>: “The guest’s excuse is accepted.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ الضَّيْفَ مَقْبُولُ العُذْرِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ: حرف مشبه بالفعل. الضيفَ: اسم إنّ منصوب بالفتحة. مقبولُ: خبر إنّ مرفوع بالضمة، اسم مفعول ومضاف إضافة لفظية. العذرِ: مضاف إليه مجرور لفظًا، نائب فاعل في المعنى</span>. Expansion: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ الضيفَ مقبولٌ عذرُهُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذرُ</span> is now <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع لفظًا</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span> referring to the guest. The added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> makes the link explicit.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبه بالفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفَ: اسم إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولِ: مجرور بالضيف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ: خبر إنّ مرفوع واسم مفعول ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولَ: اسم إنّ ثانٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العذر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العذرَ: مفعول به صريح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العذرِ: مضاف إليه؛ نائب فاعل في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العذرُ: خبر إنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "Expansion", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الضيفَ مقبولٌ العذرِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الضيفَ مقبولٌ عذرُهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الضيفَ مقبولٌ عذرَهُ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the counterexample to each claim.", "sol": "<p>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي المنقضي</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ أمسِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span>, although <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتب</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة اسم فاعل</span>. Present <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> and remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة الكتاب</span>. Test <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span> and the kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, not merely the spelling.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاتبُ الرسالةِ أمسِ: الماضي المنقضي</span> identification gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنوية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span>: present <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ: لفظية</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة مضاف إليه</span> makes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف معرفة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعامُ اليتيمِ حسنٌ</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ مُطْعِمُ اليتيمِ الآنَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعام</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>: it names feeding, and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> may be omitted without replacement. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليتيم</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and the one fed in meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُطْعِم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>: it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> and has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد. اليتيم</span> is again <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in form and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in meaning, now in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال إضافة لفظية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> cannot simply lose its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> as the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> can.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إطعام</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and may omit its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل بلا نائب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُطعم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>. The orphan receives feeding in both.", "The orphan performs the feeding in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> construction but receives it in the other.", "Both omit their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل بلا نائب</span>; neither has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة اللفظية على نيّة الانفصال، ولا تفيد التعريف</span>.</b> Expand <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ التوبةِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> is understood in an uncontracted form and does not itself confer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ التوبةِ</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةُ</span></b>: the dependent becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>. In a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التائبُ مقبولٌ توبتُهُ</span></b> makes its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> link explicit.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةِ؛</span> the original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> must remain after restoring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنوين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةُ؛ التوبة نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولٌ التوبةَ؛</span> all expansions require a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "Endings, omissions, and special forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">What is removed</h2><p>Both kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> remove the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span> remains.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></th><th>As <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمانِ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما الطالبِ</span></b>: the student's two teachers</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمونَ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو الطالبِ</span></b>: the student's teachers</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْنِ / معلّمِينَ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْ الطالبِ / معلّمِي الطالبِ</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى رفع</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب/جرّ</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم رفع</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب/جرّ</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي</span>. Dropping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> is due to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, not a change of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. It is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> used for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> may remain on the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></h2><p>Ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span> does not admit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> it is permitted in these five settings. The expressions below are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تراكيب اسمية</span>, not all complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُكْرِمَا زَيْدٍ</span></b>: the two presently honouring Zayd</td></tr><tr><td>First <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُكْرِمُو زَيْدٍ</span></b>: those presently honouring Zayd</td></tr><tr><td>Second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُكْرِمُ الرَّجُلِ</span></b>: the one honouring the man</td></tr><tr><td>Second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is added to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُكْرِمُ مُعَلِّمِ الأَوْلَادِ</span></b>: the one honouring the children's teacher</td></tr><tr><td>Second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is added to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرَّجُلُ المُكْرِمُ مُعَلِّمِهِ</span></b>: the man honouring his teacher</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The final pattern requires the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> link to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> alone in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٍ</span></b> does not meet the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> pattern's <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>. Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدًا</span></b> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, or bare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكرمُ زيدٍ</span></b> where its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> are met.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Omissions and required attachments</h2><p>An understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> can sometimes be omitted when shared: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ أبو وأخو عليٍّ</span></b>, “Ali's father and brother came.” The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> retains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة الإضافة</span>. The clearer, more frequent wording is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبو عليٍّ وأخوهُ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span> here; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span></b> follows the same pattern.</p><p>When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>'s meaning is retained but its wording omitted, directional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل، بعد، فوق، تحت، أمام، خلف</span></b>, and the relevant uses of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسب، لا غير، ليس غير</span></b>, can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ قَبْلُ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل جر</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span> by the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>. With a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مذكور</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلِ الدرسِ</span></b>, it has normal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور إعراب</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومئذٍ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ</span> replaces an omitted following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين العوض</span></b>. It is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين التنكير</span> of a newly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة إذ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ، بعض، أيّ، حيث</span></b> characteristically require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, sometimes with an understood rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مذكور</span>.</p><p>Keep the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> members adjacent in ordinary composition. Separation by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> occurs in established expressions such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاركو لي صاحبي</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لي</span> between the members; this is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span></b>, not a free licence to insert any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Meaning can affect <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> and interpretation</h2><p>A first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> may acquire the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> when that second expression can stand in for the whole: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وتضعُ كلُّ ذاتِ حملٍ حملَها</span></b>, “Every pregnant one delivers her burden.” The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث فعل</span> follows the meaning of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذات حمل</span>. This is not a general rule: in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طافَ ابنُ الأمِّ</span></b>, “The mother's son went round,” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأم</span> cannot replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابن الأم</span> without changing the person, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> is not transferred.</p><p>Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> relate a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and a quality: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جانبُ الغربيِّ</span></b>, understood as “the western side,” may instead be analysed with an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>, “the side of the western mountain.” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقَّ تلاوتِهِ</span></b> corresponds in meaning to “its true recitation.” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حبلُ الوريدِ</span></b> uses two different expressions with an explanatory relation. Recognise these readings; do not assume every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> denotes a separate owner, or freely add any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ مُعَلِّمَا الطَّالِبِ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى، وهو مضاف؛ حذفت النون للإضافة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بمعلّمَيْ الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي</span> marks the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>, while the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "What is removed"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> may remain on the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Omissions and required attachments"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Meaning can affect <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> and interpretation"}, {"id": "L8-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمان</span> and select the retained <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ معلّما الطالبِ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل المثنّى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالألف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بمعلّمَيْ الطالبِ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مثنّى</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي. ن</span> is removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> in both, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ <span class=\"blank\"></span> الطالبِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما: مرفوع بالألف، حذفت النون للإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي: مرفوع بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمانِ: تبقى النون في الإضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بـ <span class=\"blank\"></span> الطالبِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْ: مجرور بالياء، حذفت النون للإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْنِ: تبقى النون في الإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما: مجرور بالألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "In the current-action use, check <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مضاف</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ الرجلِ</span></b> meets the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> that the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span>. Repair the other as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> remains, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> is now the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> alone does not license <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> first term of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ الرجلِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Forbidden: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> can never occur on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>", "Permitted: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضاف إليه</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>", "Permitted only because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "Repair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٍ</span> while retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٌ</span>: make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدًا: مفعول به</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٍ</span> unchanged: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span> is sufficient"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span></b> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>’s meaning understood.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبني على الضم في محل جر بمن</span>, with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>'s meaning understood though its wording is omitted. The visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة؛ الضمة علامة نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة؛ من لا تعمل هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل جر بمن</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span> in these constructions.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ معلّمو الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو لأنه جمع مذكر سالم؛ حذفت النون للإضافة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ معلّمِي الطالبِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم؛ حذفت النون للإضافة. الطالب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in each. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبوا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> is deleted because the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل من الأفعال الخمسة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span>. Its following written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ا</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> marker.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّمو الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو: فعل مجزوم بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو: فاعل مرفوع بالواو؛ حذف النون للإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو: منصوب بالواو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت معلّمي الطالب</span>: several male teachers", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي: مضارع منصوب بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي: مجرور لأن فيه ياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي: مفعول به منصوب بالياء؛ حذف النون للإضافة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون؛ الواو فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مضاف؛ الواو علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع؛ حذف النون للإضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Explain the omissions.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومئذٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم</span> is added to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ</span> replaces an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة: تنوين العوض</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبو وأخو عليٍّ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه محذوف</span> understood as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span> visibly supplies the shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. More usual: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ أبو عليٍّ وأخوهُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع, أخو</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف مرفوع</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علي</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومئذٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين التنكير يجعل إذ نكرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين تمكين على يوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين العوض على إذ عن جملة محذوفة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبو وأخو عليٍّ: مضاف إليه</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لأبو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عليّ</span> understood from the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> is expressed or understood"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "More usual wording", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبا عليٍّ وأخوهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبٌ وأخو عليٍّ</span> with the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> analysis", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبو عليٍّ وأخوهُ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8I-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل المكرم معلمه</span></b>, “the man honouring his teacher,” taking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرَّجُلُ المُكْرِمُ مُعَلِّمِهِ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> being described, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> in the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة. المكرم</span>: its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع وصف, اسم فاعل ومضاف. معلّمِ: مضاف إليه مجرور، مفعول به في المعنى، وهو مضاف. ه: ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه يعود إلى الرجل المحلّى بأل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span> also returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span>. This is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شبه جملة</span>; a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> would need a suitable surrounding structure.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمِ: مضاف إليه للرجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ: وصف مرفوع، اسم فاعل ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمِ: مضاف إليه للمكرم، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمُ: نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَ: حال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى الرجل المحلّى بأل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى المعلّم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "Why <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> is permitted on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> contains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>", "Because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه معرفة</span> permits it, without further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ الرجلِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>?", "sol": "<p>Present <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ الكتابِ</span></b> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> does not confer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ الرجلِ</span></b> has its own permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span>; this makes it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> dependent licenses this form but does not itself transfer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> does not supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرم</span> has its own permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, so it cannot be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُذفت النون للإضافة، وبقيت علامة الإعراب</span>.</b> Identify the retained sign in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو الطالبِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>“The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> was removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, while the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> sign remained.” In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو الطالب</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> remains as the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span>'s sign of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: علامة جزم الاسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو: علامة رفع جمع المذكر السالم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "Specifying the meaning of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاسم المبهم التام</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبهم معنىً</span></b> means not yet specified in meaning. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّ لفظًا</span></b> means complete in form: in its present construction the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> cannot simply become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to the following specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. It governs <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز الذات</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> expression identifying what is measured, counted, or otherwise specified.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِنْدِي رَطْلَانِ زَيْتًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I have two raṭls of oil. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطل</span></b> is a unit of weight; no modern conversion is needed here. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span> gives the amount; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span> tells what the amount consists of.</span></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">How a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is complete</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form of completeness</th><th>Expression</th><th>Specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنها ساءتْ مستقرًّا</span></b>: it is bad as a resting-place</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستقرًّا</span> specifies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساءت</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا أراد اللهُ بهذا مثلًا؟</span></b>: What did Allah intend by this as an example?</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثلًا</span> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></td></tr><tr><td>Already in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِلْءُ الأرضِ ذهبًا</span></b>: the earth's fill of gold</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبًا</span> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملء الأرض</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين ظاهر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلٌ زيتًا</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span></td></tr><tr><td>Completeness treated like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين مقدّر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثاقيلُ ذهبًا</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم يومًا صمتَ؟</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبًا</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى نون</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلانِ زيتًا</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> in a numeral resembling the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثونَ شهرًا</span></b>: thirty months</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شهرًا</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِثْقَال / مَثَاقِيل</span></b> = weight-unit / weight-units; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِلْء</span></b> = amount filling something. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثاقيل</span> does not visibly take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> in this form; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين مقدّر</span>” explains their completeness here, not an instruction to pronounce an unpronounced <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم يومًا صمتَ؟</span></b> means “How many days did you fast?”</p><p>Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز النسبة</span></b>, specification of a whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إسناد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طابَ خالدٌ نفسًا</span></b>, “Khalid was content at heart.” Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل طاب</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز الذات</span> here, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام</span>, even when a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> also occurs in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. Not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة منصوب</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِنْدِي رَطْلَانِ زَيْتًا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان منصوب، وهو مضاف؛ الياء في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> attaches to an omitted general-existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and occupies the fronted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلانِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى؛ اسم مبهم تام بنون التثنية</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات منصوب بالفتحة، عامله رطلان</span>.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى ن</span> remains because this is not <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلا الزيتِ</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>. Both identify oil, but their structures and endings differ.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "How a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is complete"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي رطلانِ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>. What does the last word supply?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي رطلانِ زيتًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span> specifies how much, but not what substance. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات منصوب بالفتحة</span>, governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام رطلان</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا: تمييز ذات منصوب</span> identifies the measured substance.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتٍ: مضاف إليه</span>, while retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتٌ: فاعل</span> for the action of weighing."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify how each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّ</span> in its construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان: مثنّى ن. ثلاثون</span>: numeral <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> resembling the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> pattern. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملء الأرض</span>: an already complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, so a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> cannot simply be a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> directly attached to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملء</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التثنية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون شبه الجمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التثنية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون شبه الجمع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملء الأرض</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التثنية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> already completed", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين ملفوظ على ملء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Compare the structures.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلانِ زيتًا</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> and gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيت نصب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلا الزيتِ</span></b> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزيت جرّ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Similar meanings can be expressed through different constructions.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلانِ زيتًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> removed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> remains; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا تمييز منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلا الزيتِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزيتِ فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزيتِ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزيتِ تمييز</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي عشرون كتابا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِنْدِي عِشْرُونَ كِتَابًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند: ظرف مكان منصوب ومضاف؛ ياء المتكلم في محل جر مضاف إليه. عندي</span> attaches to omitted general existence and occupies the fronted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر. عشرون: مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالواو، ملحق بجمع المذكر السالم؛ ن</span> marks the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s completeness here. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: تمييز ذات منصوب بالفتحة، عامله عشرون</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is formed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عند</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان منصوب ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ظاهر لعشرون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعلق بمحذوف؛ شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالواو، ملحق بجمع المذكر السالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: تمييز ذات منصوب، عامله عشرون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ: نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابِ: مضاف إليه لعشرون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم يومًا صمتَ؟</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات منصوب</span> governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>, specifying the count asked about. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span> itself is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب ظرف زمان</span> here: the question asks how many days the fasting lasted. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صمتَ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طاب سعيدٌ نفسًا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز نسبة</span>, governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طاب</span>, specifying the respect in which the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إسناد</span> is true. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>. The second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> clarifies a whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إسناد</span>, not a counted or measured <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم يومًا صمتَ؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا: تمييز نسبة، عامله صام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم: حرف جرّ؛ يومًا مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا: تمييز ذات، عامله كم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طابَ سعيدٌ نفسًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا: مفعول به لفعل متعدٍّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا: تمييز ذات، عامله سعيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا: تمييز نسبة، عامله طاب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9R", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Differentiate the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبات</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل معتمد دالّ على الحال حامل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقًا</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة تمييز</span> governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة حسن</span>, specifying the quality's respect. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات</span> governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام رطلان</span>, identifying the measured substance. All are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>; their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and relationships differ.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاملٌ كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات لاسم مبهم تامّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز للصفة المشبهة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حسنٌ خلقًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال يصف هيئة خالد وقت الحمل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز للصفة المشبهة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي رطلانِ زيتًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لرطلان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لعند</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات لاسم مبهم تامّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل في تمييز الذات الاسم المبهم التام، والعامل في تمييز النسبة الفعل</span>.</b> Choose each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز الذات</span> is governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز النسبة</span> by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>. Thus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طاب</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا</span>. Do not choose the nearest <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> automatically as the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلانِ زيتًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طابَ خالدٌ نفسًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طاب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الشرط</span> for people and things", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Core rule and terms</h2><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span></b> can govern two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span></b>: the first is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span></b>; the second is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span></b>, also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزاء</span></b>. Unlike the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف إنْ</span>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> also fills a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> role within the construction.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ</span></b> refers to a person or rational being, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العاقل</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> and normally <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهما</span></b> refer to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير العاقل</span></b>, things or actions. Translate according to context: whoever, whatever.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ يَصْدُقْ يَنْجَحْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Whoever speaks truth succeeds.</span></div><p>Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومة بالسكون. مَنْ</span> occupies a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع مبتدأ</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة بناء</span> does not visibly change to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\">Determine the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s role from the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>First <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s construction</th><th>Role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من / ما / مهما</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Does not need a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> here</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يصدقْ ينجحْ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td>Needs a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, already supplied by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تُكرمْهُ يُكرمْكَ</span></b>: Whoever you honour, he honours you</td></tr><tr><td>Needs a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> not supplied by such a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تُكرمْ يُكرمْكَ</span></b>: Whomever you honour honours you</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقتضي مفعولًا</span></b> means “requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>”; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد</span></b> means “a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring back.” Notice the difference made by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكرمه</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُكرم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>.</p><p>When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>, use this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> analysis: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة الشرط في محل رفع خبر</span></b>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> with that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> forms the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> follows. A recognised alternative treats both the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> together as the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. Use one account consistently. When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> with the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> forms the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; do not invent a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ تُكْرِمْ يُكْرِمْكَ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم لتكرم</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكرمْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم، فعل الشرط؛ علامة جزمه السكون، والفاعل ضمير مستتر تقديره أنت</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكرمْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم، جواب الشرط؛ علامة جزمه السكون، والفاعل ضمير مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى من</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل في محل نصب مفعول به</span>.</li></ul><p>Add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تكرمْه يكرمْك</span></b>. Now <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> occupies the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> becomes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع مبتدأ</span></b>. Translate first, then check both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> references.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Core rule and terms"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "Determine the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s role from the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the terms to their functions.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>: a person; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>: a thing/action; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط: فعل الشرط</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجزاء: جواب</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الشرطية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الشرطية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للزمان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزاء</span>", "The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير العائد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجزاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What is the role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تكرمْ يكرمْك</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُكرم</span> means “you honour” and needs the person honoured; no following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> occupies that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ؛</span> every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الشرطية</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم لتكرم؛</span> the required position has no returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط لا محل له من الإعراب</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10G-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تكرمْه يكرمْك</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تكرمْه يكرمْك</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به</span> and returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من. من</span> therefore occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع مبتدأ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> still has the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر أنت</span>. Changing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span> does not change that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكرمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى من</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به لتكرم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل تكرم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف في يكرمك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعد يساعدك</span></b> before adding any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ تُسَاعِدْ يُسَاعِدْكَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من: اسم شرط جازم مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم. تساعدْ: فعل الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت. يساعدْ: جواب الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى من. ك: ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْه يساعدْك</span></b>. It now fills the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>'s position and returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>, which becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة الشرط</span> occupies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر</span> under the chosen account.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> with an expressed returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعدَ: منصوب، فاعله أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعدُ: مرفوع، فاعله هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعدْ: فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون، فاعله أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يساعدك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يساعدْ: جواب الشرط مجزوم، فاعله هو؛ ك مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يساعدُ: خبر مرفوع، ك فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يساعدَ: منصوب، ك مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "Change making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من مبتدأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْ يساعدْه</span>: change only the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْ يساعدْك</span> without change", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْه يساعدْك</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكتبْ أقرأْهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَا تَكْتُبْ أَقْرَأْهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما: اسم شرط جازم مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم لتكتب. تكتبْ: فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون، فاعله أنت. أقرأْ: جواب الشرط مجزوم بالسكون، فاعله أنا. ه: مفعول به يعود إلى ما</span>, the thing written. It fills the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>, not the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> therefore remains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم لتكتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مجزوم، فاعله أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط منصوب، فاعله هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط مرفوع، فاعله أنا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر، فاعله أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط مجزوم، فاعله أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مرفوع، فاعله هو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لأقرأ يعود إلى ما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لتكتب يعود إلى أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لما</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تكتبْ أقرأْ</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكتبْ أقرأْهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم لا محل له من الإعراب</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> and fills the writing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Both govern two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. In the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة, ه</span> explicitly returns to the thing written; no such <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> or reference is introduced by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> itself.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف شرط بلا محل</span> because both govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط بلا محل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Both govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا اشتغل فعل الشرط بضمير اسم الشرط، كان اسم الشرط مبتدأ</span>.</b> Apply it to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْه يساعدْك</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span> has its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span> occupied by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>, that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من تساعدْه يساعدْك</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is that returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span> fills the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> position of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعد</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> remains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> fills the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> position of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعد</span> and returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تساعد</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> becomes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الشرط</span> for time and place, and the uses of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span>", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Complete the inventory</h2><p>The inventory taught here contains eleven forms: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من، ما، مهما، متى، إذاما، أيّان، أين، أينما، أنّى، حيثما، أيّ</span></b>. Keep this classification when doing the exercises.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Meaning and role here</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى، إذاما، أيّان</span></b></td><td>Time: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تفعلْ</span>… “whenever you do…”</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أين، أينما، أنّى</span></b></td><td>Place: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما تجلسْ</span>… “wherever you sit…”</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span></b></td><td>Place or time according to context</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></b></td><td>Depends on what is added to it and on the construction</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The seven <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان/مكان</span> forms occupy <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول فيه مقدّم</span></b> while governing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span></b> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيث</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة</span></b>, which blocks its ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span> pattern and allows the conditional use.</p><p>For consistency, treat <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذاما</span> as the temporal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> in this inventory. Do not confuse it with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>. Some other grammatical classifications handle this distinction differently; the exercises use the inventory above.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\">Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> role are not identical</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهما</span> can also convey a temporal sense in established usage, “whenever.” Nevertheless, the role rule used here groups <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من، ما، مهما</span></b> together as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء شرط غير ظرفية</span>; do not automatically label <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهما مفعولًا فيه</span> merely from an English “whenever.” Practise its ordinary “whatever” use first.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>. Read both its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>'s need:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ طالبٍ يصدقْ ينجحْ</span></b>: whichever student speaks truth succeeds: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْهُ</span></b>: whichever book you read, you understand: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم منصوب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ يومٍ تسافرْ أسافرْ</span></b>: whichever day you travel, I travel: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول فيه منصوب</span>.</li></ul><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات الشرط غير الجازمة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b> and temporal <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> added to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. They carry <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> meaning but do not cause <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا جاءَ خالدٌ أكرمتُهُ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا جاءَ خالدٌ أكرمتُهُ</span></b>. Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظرفية</span> “when” here from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا الجازمة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ</span></b>, “he has not arrived yet.”</p><p>Recall the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات الجزم: سكون</span> for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span>; deletion of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>; deletion of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف العلة</span>. Thus <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما تكونوا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسعَ تنجحْ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعَ</span>, from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعى. الأفعال الماضية</span> in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط جازم</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span> and occupy the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> position; do not invent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> endings for them. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ف</span> keep the linking rules already learned.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَيْنَمَا تَجْلِسْ أَجْلِسْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Wherever you sit, I sit.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم في محل نصب مفعول فيه مقدّم، متعلق بتجلس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلسْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجلسْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنا</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْهُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب مفعول به مقدّم</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقرأ</span>, with visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. The two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت. ه</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهم</span> and returns to the chosen book.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s5\">Recognise a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم غير عامل</span></h2><p>Outside <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الفعل، الاسم المبهم التام، الاسم المضاف، أسماء الشرط</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير عامل</span></b> in this classification. That does not mean it lacks a role or cannot itself be governed: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء سعيدٌ</span></b> is a governed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, without thereby governing another word.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Complete the inventory"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> role are not identical"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات الشرط غير الجازمة</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s5", "title": "Recognise a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم غير عامل</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the meanings in the inventory taught here.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّان</span>: time. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّى</span>: place. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span>: time or place according to context in this inventory.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للزمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للزمان فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للزمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل فقط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للزمان فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل دون الظرفية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للمكان أو الزمان بحسب السياق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل فقط</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ / أيَّ / أيِّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْه</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْهُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span> required by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقرأ, منصوب بالفتحة</span>, and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف. كتابٍ</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> returns to the book.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ: مفعول به مقدّم لتقرأ، وهو مضاف؛ كتابٍ مضاف إليه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ: كل اسم شرط مجرور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ: مبتدأ؛ تقرأ</span> already has its own returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "11G-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the uses of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ خالدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم</span>, “has not arrived yet”; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بالسكون</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا وصلَ خالدٌ أكرمتُهُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span> is temporal “when,” added to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, and does not cause <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم. وصل</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> recounts what happened on his arrival.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ خالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم؛</span> has not arrived yet", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف غير جازم؛</span> when he arrived", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط يجزم فعلين</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا وصلَ خالدٌ أكرمتُهُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف غير جازم؛</span> when he arrived", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم؛</span> has not arrived yet", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسعى تنجح</span></b> with the required signs.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَتَى تَسْعَ تَنْجَحْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى: اسم شرط جازم مبني على السكون في محل نصب ظرف زمان مقدّم متعلق بتسع. تسعَ: فعل الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة، أصله تسعى؛ فاعله أنت. تنجحْ: جواب الشرط، مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله أنت</span>. The remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before the deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> ending.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لتنجح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعَ: منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعَ: فعل الشرط مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة، فاعله أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعى: مجزوم مع بقاء الألف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجحَ: منصوب بمتى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجحُ: خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنجحْ: جواب الشرط مجزوم بالسكون، فاعله أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أي يوم تسافر أسافر</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أي طالب يصدق ينجح</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَيَّ يَوْمٍ تُسَافِرْ أُسَافِرْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ: اسم شرط منصوب على الظرفية، وهو مضاف. يوم: مضاف إليه مجرور. تسافرْ: فعل الشرط مجزوم، فاعله أنت. أسافرْ: جواب الشرط مجزوم، فاعله أنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ طالبٍ يصدقْ ينجحْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لازم يصدق</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ طالب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينجح</span> likewise has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>. A person is being specified in the second construction, rather than a time.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ يومٍ: ظرف زمان منصوب ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ يومٍ: مجرور دون جارّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ يومٍ: مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسافر / أسافر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسافرْ وأسافرْ مجزومان؛ الفاعلان أنت وأنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبان؛ الفاعل هو في كليهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعان؛ الفاعلان هو وهي</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ طالبٍ: مبتدأ مرفوع ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ طالبٍ: ظرف زمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ طالبٍ: مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدق / ينجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدقُ وينجحُ مرفوعان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدقْ وينجحْ مجزومان؛ فاعلهما هو يعود إلى أيّ طالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدقَ وينجحَ منصوبان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "11I-3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the counterexample to each statement.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> carries <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> meaning but is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم. شرطي ما</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكتبْ أقرأْه</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسعَ تنجحْ</span></b> occupies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول فيه</span>. Governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> and possessing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> position are compatible.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Every expression with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> meaning governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تكتبْ أقرأْ: إنْ جازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا جاء خالدٌ أكرمتُه: إذا غير جازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسعَ تنجحْ: متى جازمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل إعراب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تكتبْ أقرأْ: إنْ حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ: لم حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكتبْ أقرأْه: ما في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11R", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْهُ</span></b> contrasted with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء سعيدٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقرأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهم</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. It is itself the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقرأ</span>, hence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب. تقرأ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر أنت</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ه</span> referring to the chosen book. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء سعيدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> is governed as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> but is not itself a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span> in this classification.</p>", "group": "11R|Review", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "What governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span>?", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهم: أيّ نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب: أيّ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقرأ: أيّ مفعول به مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل أيّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم كتاب وجرّ الفعلين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع كتاب ونصب الفعلين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ كتاب بالإضافة وجزم الفعلين بالشرط</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى الكتاب المختار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى أنت</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء سعيدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يجرّ جاء بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط يجزم جاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل معمول لجاء، غير عامل هنا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب أيّ بحسب ما تضاف إليه، وإذا ولمّا الظرفية غير جازمين</span>.</b> Choose the application.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> depends on what it is added to and its construction. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ طالبٍ يصدقْ</span></b>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>; in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span>; in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ يومٍ تسافرْ</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف. إذا</span> and temporal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span> do not govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. Negative <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ</span></b> does.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ طالبٍ يصدقْ ينجحْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ: مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ: ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تفهمْه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ: مبتدأ مع ه بعد تقرأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ: مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ: مفعول به مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ يومٍ تسافرْ أسافرْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ: فاعل لتسافر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ: ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا / لمّا الظرفية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجزمان فعلين دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تتضمنان معنى الشرط ولا تجزمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجرّان كل فعل بعدهما</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and the relationship", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Work without the lesson tables first. Give reasons, not just endings. For full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>, include <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف, ضمير, شبه جملة تعلّق</span>, and each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s own role as well as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Classify each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> in the supplied expression.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span></b> is a governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر: الطالب</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور</span> in meaning, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span> itself is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حافظ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل معتمد دالّ على الحال, خبر</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح الدرسَ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمود</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, raising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلقُ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> refers to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسن</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة خلقًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رطلان</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام, مبتدأ مؤخر</span>, governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيتًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط, مبتدأ</span>, governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدق</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينجح</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الدرسَ نافعةٌ: قراءة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول يرفع الطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر؛ الطالب فاعله في المعنى والدرس مفعوله</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ حافظٌ الدرسَ</span> (now): <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حافظ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل؛ فاعله مستتر ومفعوله الدرس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر لا فاعل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم تفضيل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ محمودٌ خلقُه: محمود</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل ينصب خلقه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة تجرّ خلقه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول يرفع نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ حسنٌ خلقًا: حسن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة مشبهة تنصب التمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل متعدٍّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول يرفع خلقًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عندي رطلانِ زيتًا: رطلان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف يجرّ زيتًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبهم تام ينصب تمييز الذات</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يصدقْ ينجحْ: من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ليصدق في هذه الجملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط يجزم فعلين، في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the correction for each claim.", "sol": "<p>Not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in meaning, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ</span></b> expresses association. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> does not confer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span> to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم نكرة</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن للمفضّل عليه</span>, use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختها</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> belongs to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> pattern, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدار الكبرى</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مضاف إليه فاعل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الكتابِ: الكتاب مفعول به في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الكتابَ: الطالب فاعل في المعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنُ الخلقِ: الخلق فاعل في المعنى</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل إضافة تفيد التعريف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة اللفظية لا تفيده، والمعنوية إلى نكرة تفيد التخصيص</span>", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظية</span>", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمة علامة رفع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في جاء خالدٌ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ في عندي كتابٌ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ في من قبلُ مبني على الضم في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم التفضيل مع مِن يطابق المؤنث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ أكبرُ من أختها: يلزم الإفراد والتذكير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكبر</span> must become a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> when used with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ كبرى من أختها</span> is required"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Supply the analyses: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن سعيدا حامل في يده رسالة</span></b> (now); <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة أفضل من أختها</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِنَّ سَعِيدًا حَامِلٌ فِي يَدِهِ رِسَالَةً</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر. حامل</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل دالّ على الحال</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد. في</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدِ</span>, which governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في يده</span> attaches to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل. رسالةً</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>'s separated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> directly attached to it. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَاطِمَةُ أَفْضَلُ مِنْ أُخْتِهَا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة: مبتدأ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفضل: خبر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم تفضيل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هي</span>; it remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر مفرد</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن. أخت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> and governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه. ها</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and transformations", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ: مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا: اسم إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملِ: مضاف إليه لسعيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملًا: حال بلا اعتماد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ: خبر إنّ؛ اعتماده على اسمها ودلالته على الحال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل حامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى سعيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في يده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يده</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدَه مفعول به؛ في غير عاملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدِ مجرور بفي، والهاء مضاف إليه؛ شبه الجملة متعلق بحامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدُه نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةِ: مضاف إليه لحامل رغم الفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً: مفعول به منصوب مع الفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةٌ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة / أفضل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ فاعل ظاهر لأفضل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةُ مبتدأ؛ أفضلُ خبر مفرد مذكر، فاعله مستتر هي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمةَ مفعول به؛ أفضلَ فعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من أختها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أختُ خبر؛ ها حرف خطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أختَ مفعول به؛ ها فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أختِ مجرور بمن؛ ها مضاف إليه يعود إلى فاطمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Expand <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ مقبولُ العذرِ</span></b>; then add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّمانِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ مقبولٌ عذرُهُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف: مبتدأ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبول: خبر واسم مفعول</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذرُ: نائب فاعل مرفوع ومضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه: مضاف إليه يعود إلى الضيف</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبولُ العذرِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> concealed that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>'s ordinary surface <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ معلّما الطالبِ</span></b> removes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى ن</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا مرفوعًا بالألف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Here the student is associated with the teachers, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and transformations", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Expanded expression", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ مقبولٌ العذرِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ مقبولٌ عذرُهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ مقبولٌ عذرَهُ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذرُه</span> in that expansion", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال؛ الهاء حرف خطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل؛ الهاء مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به؛ الهاء فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "The student’s two teachers came", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّمَيْ الطالبِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّما الطالبِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّمانِ الطالبِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبِ</span> in the last expression", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع لجاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> expressing association with the teachers", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل لاسم مفعول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "B3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the endings and repair the last expression.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل مبني على الضم</span>, in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> position, with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>'s meaning retained. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلِ الدرسِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل</span> visibly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس مجرور</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومئذٍ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ</span> replaces an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. Repair the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span> as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدًا</span></b>, an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span> rather than an unlicensed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد الـ إضافة</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and transformations", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل: منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل: مبني على الضم في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل: مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلِ الدرسِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل: مجرور بمن ومضاف؛ الدرس مضاف إليه</span>", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> directly by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل: مبني على الكسر؛ الدرس فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومئذٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين التنكير على يوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين العوض على إذ عن جملة محذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين التمكين على إذ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "Repair <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٍ</span>, retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٌ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكرمُ زيدٍ</span> unchanged"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح خالد باب بيت المعلم. هو حامل كتابا الآن. في الكتاب عشرون مثالا. قال المعلم: دونك الكتاب</span>.</b> Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَتَحَ خَالِدٌ بَابَ بَيْتِ المُعَلِّمِ. هُوَ حَامِلٌ كِتَابًا الآنَ. فِي الكِتَابِ عِشْرُونَ مِثَالًا. قَالَ المُعَلِّمُ: دُونَكَ الكِتَابَ</span>.</b></p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلمِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. Khalid opened the door of the teacher's house.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل مبني في محل رفع مبتدأ، يعود إلى خالد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع، اسم فاعل عامل، يعتمد على المبتدأ ويدل على الحال؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل منصوب بالفتحة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآنَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان مبني على الفتح في محل نصب متعلق بحامل</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> attaches to an omitted general-existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and occupies the fronted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرونَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالواو، ملحق بجمع المذكر السالم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثالًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز ذات منصوب بالفتحة، عامله عشرون. ن</span> remains because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span> is complete, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثال</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلمُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونكَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر بمعنى خذ، والكاف للخطاب؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت، أي خالد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The quoted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول</span>, occupying the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال</span>.</li></ul><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء عاملة</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيت</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة, حامل</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل الفعل, عشرون</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل. كتابًا</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء عاملة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> is governed by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>. Do not infer from repeated vocabulary that the same role repeats.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحُ: اسم مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحَ: فعل ماضٍ مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحْ: فعل أمر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابَ: مفعول به ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابِ: مضاف إليه لفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيت المعلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتُ: مبتدأ؛ المعلمُ: خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتِ: مضاف إليه ومضاف؛ المعلمِ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتَ والمعلمَ: مفعولان لفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تنبيه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل رفع مبتدأ يعود إلى خالد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملٌ: خبر واسم فاعل، فاعله مستتر هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملًا: حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ: مصدر بلا فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابا / الآن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ فاعل؛ الآن خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا مفعول به لحامل؛ الآن ظرف متعلق بحامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابِ مضاف إليه رغم تنوين حامل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ مجرور بفي؛ شبه الجملة خبر مقدّم متعلق بمحذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في اسم فعل والكتاب فاعله</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ مفعول به لعشرون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون مثالا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرونَ مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالواو؛ مثالًا تمييز، والنون باقية لعدم الإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون مضاف؛ مثالٍ مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون فعل مضارع ومثالًا مفعوله</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال المعلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالَ فعل ماضٍ؛ المعلمُ فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالْ فعل أمر؛ المعلمَ مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالُ مبتدأ؛ المعلمُ خبر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ؛ ك مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر؛ ك للخطاب، والفاعل مستتر أنت أي خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ؛ ك فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ: مفعول به لاسم الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ: نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دونك الكتاب</span> as a whole after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة شرط في محل جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لقال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقول القول في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يقرأ يفهم. ما تكتب أقرأه. أينما تجلس أجلس</span>.</b> Reading is used generally in the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ يَقْرَأْ يَفْهَمْ. مَا تَكْتُبْ أَقْرَأْهُ. أَيْنَمَا تَجْلِسْ أَجْلِسْ</span>.</b></p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم مبني على السكون في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى من</span>. Reading is used generally here, without an outstanding specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفهمْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله هو يعود إلى من</span>. Under the chosen account, the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>. “Whoever reads understands.”</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله أنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى ما</span>. “Whatever you write, I read it.”</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم في محل نصب مفعول فيه مقدّم متعلق بتجلس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلسْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجلسْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط مجزوم بالسكون؛ فاعله أنا</span>. “Wherever you sit, I sit.”</li></ul><p>The three initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> govern the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> pattern but occupy three different positions: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ، مفعول به، مفعول فيه</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ / يفهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأَ ويفهمَ منصوبان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأْ ويفهمْ مجزومان؛ فاعلهما مستتر هو يعود إلى من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ ويفهمُ مرفوعان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل رفع مبتدأ مع ه بعد تكتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به لتكتب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتب / أقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ وأقرأْ فاعلهما هو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبْ: فعل الشرط فاعله أنت؛ أقرأْ: جواب الشرط فاعله أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبُ وأقرأُ خبران مرفوعان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لتكتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى ما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط في محل نصب ظرف مكان متعلق بتجلس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لأجلس</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلس / أجلس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلسَ وأجلسَ منصوبان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلسُ وأجلسُ مرفوعان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجلسْ وأجلسْ مجزومان؛ الفاعلان أنت وأنا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون الاسم معمولًا لعامل، وعاملًا في غيره. ولا يكفي النظر إلى الحركة لتعيين العلاقة</span>.</b> Apply both points.", "sol": "<p>“A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> can be governed by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> while governing something else. Looking at the vowel alone is insufficient to identify the relationship.” In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ الطالبَ حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع</span> and a governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>; it is also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span>. The book is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in meaning. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span></b>, the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> marks a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, while the position is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>. Name both the relationship and the kind of ending.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاملُ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الطالبَ حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول لإنّ كخبر؛ عامل في الكتاب بالإضافة، وله فاعل مستتر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير معمول لأنه عامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير عامل لأنه خبر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم مع محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لأن كل ظرف منصوب لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع لمجرد ظهور الضمة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the distinction supported by each pair.", "sol": "<p>Possible concise Arabic answers:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة المشبهة مشتقة من فعل لازم، نحو: خالدٌ حسنٌ خلقُهُ؛ فخلقُه فاعل. واسم المفعول يعمل عمل فعله المجهول، نحو: خالدٌ محمودٌ خلقُهُ؛ فخلقُه نائب فاعل</span>.</b></li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإضافة المعنوية تفيد التعريف أو التخصيص، نحو: كتابُ الطالبِ وكتابُ طالبٍ. والإضافة اللفظية تفيد التخفيف ولا تفيد التعريف، نحو: حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ، أي حاملٌ الكتابَ</span>.</b></li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الشرط له محل من الإعراب، نحو: ما تكتبْ أقرأْهُ؛ فما مفعول به مقدّم. وحرف الشرط لا محل له، نحو: إنْ تكتبْ أقرأْ. وكلاهما يجزم فعل الشرط وجوابه</span>.</b></li></ul>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسنٌ خلقُه / محمودٌ خلقُه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأول اسم مفعول والثاني مصدر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأول صفة مشبهة ترفع فاعلًا؛ الثاني اسم مفعول يرفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما اسم مفعول يرفع نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُ الطالبِ / حاملُ الكتابِ الآنَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما لفظية لا تفيد التعريف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأولى معنوية تفيد التعريف؛ الثانية لفظية لا تفيده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما معنوية تفيد التعريف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكتبْ أقرأْه / إنْ تكتبْ أقرأْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما اسم شرط يجرّ الأفعال؛ إنْ تجزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما حرف شرط بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما اسم شرط له محل؛ إنْ حرف شرط لا محل له؛ كلاهما يجزم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "E1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete a coherent study passage with the requested structures, then select each reason. Use the supplied meanings.", "sol": "<p>The completed passage:</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِرَاءَةُ الطَّالِبِ الدَّرْسَ نَافِعَةٌ. هُوَ حَامِلٌ فِي يَدِهِ كِتَابًا الآنَ. فِي الكِتَابِ عِشْرُونَ مِثَالًا. مَا يَكْتُبْ يَقْرَأْهُ</span>.</b></p><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة: مصدر عامل، مبتدأ مرفوع ومضاف. الطالب: مضاف إليه</span> and reader in meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس: مفعول به منصوب</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر. نافعة: خبر مرفوع</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو: مبتدأ</span> returning to the student. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل: اسم فاعل معتمد دالّ على الحال, خبر مرفوع</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو. في يده</span> attaches to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> and governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه. كتابًا</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب. الآن</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span>. The intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في يده</span> prevents direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الكتاب: خبر شبه جملة مقدّم</span> attached to an omitted general-existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر. عشرون: مبتدأ مؤخر مرفوع بالواو. مثالًا: تمييز ذات</span> governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون, منصوب. ن</span> remains because this is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما: اسم شرط</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب. يكتب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: مجزوم شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>, each with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span> referring to the student. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>. Meaning: “Whatever he writes, he reads it.”</li></ul><p>Each row has one correct choice. Check the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفاعل</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمن</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد</span>, the separation before its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>, the completeness of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>, and both the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>'s own role and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>' <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "E|Transfer task", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>: “The student’s reading of the lesson is useful.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الدرسَ نافعةٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبُ الدرسَ نافعةٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءةُ الطالبِ الدرسُ نافعةٌ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>: “He is carrying a book in his hand now.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو حاملٌ في يدِهِ كتابِ الآنَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو حاملًا في يدِهِ كتابٌ الآنَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو حاملٌ في يدِهِ كتابًا الآنَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "Why <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامل</span> governs here", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد على المبتدأ ودلالة على الحال؛ كتابًا منصوب مع الفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتماد على كتاب، وهو مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ موجودة في حامل فلا يحتاج إلى أي شرط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>: “There are twenty examples in the book.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الكتابِ عشرونَ مثالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الكتابِ عشرينَ مثالٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الكتابِ عشرونَ مثالًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>: “Whatever he writes, he reads it.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يكتبَ يقرأَهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يكتبْ يقرأْهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما يكتبُ يقرأُهُ</span> in the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> use"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> in the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم ليكتب؛ يجزم الفعلين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span> contains a returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط بلا محل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى الطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى ما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You are ready when you can name a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s type, its own role, and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> separately; justify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مشتقّ</span>; distinguish both kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; recognise the different analyses behind a visible ending; and assign a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span> its own position while explaining both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>' <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p><p>Use the answer explanations to locate a specific gap, then redo the relevant independent task with the answers closed.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li>Confusing a word type with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> role: Introduction and Lessons 1–3.</li><li>Treating every unexpressed participant alike: Lessons 1–2.</li><li>Reading every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به صريح</span>: Lessons 3 and 9.</li><li>Making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم تفضيل</span> agree in every construction: Lesson 4.</li><li>Treating a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> meaning as proof of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: Lesson 5.</li><li>Giving every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span> or participant analysis: Lessons 6–7.</li><li>Confusing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ن</span> deletion with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ن</span> deletion, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>: Lesson 8.</li><li>Finding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> but missing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>'s own position: Lessons 10–11.</li></ul>"};
